{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Unwrap asynchronous failures before classifying them as non-fatal.** A factory or hook that calls `CompletableFuture.join()` can throw a `CompletionException` wrapping `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`; this method logs the wrapper and continues execution. Unwrap completion wrappers before these checks, rethrow the fatal cause, and add wrapped-fatal factory/hook tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74nsjY","finding_digest":"88b23bdc3869144c3fb6a489c2eee914df7c542035f07d6a646f92a0fdb76262","finding_id":"arf_v1_rczdxxbynekeyp5wuse4f3xjct","finding_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::contain::wrapped-fatal-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::contain::wrapped-fatal-propagation","line":185,"observation_digest":"d1bd08facb52c7a1025847a68a8c9a7e44ca72f6649558690f309c1e62592cc3","observation_id":"aro_v1_2g6qr6wlkld2casyi6tivde2pz","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-03T01:40:47Z","review_id":"arr_v1_obth4iyaj7ebllsk2q4fq2hrdn","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"9ec15bef9250b997ce9bcd2778478b350b5d7bc5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":181,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_rwszufoxabq3bhv6t55e6uo5dj","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T01:40:47Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
